/Title (Digitalization of inspections, material & equipment tracking systems, integration of construction data into centralized platforms, and development of proprietary progress / productivity / risk-control systems connecting contractors, engineering, QA/QC and commissioning. Self-built SQL project database \(34 projects, about 140,000 documents\) connected to Power BI and published as an online portfolio \(nestorgarcia-mcm.github.io\). AI assistants \(Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft 365 Copilot\) for specification, datasheet and contract review, correspondence triage and reporting, with reusable instructions, scheduled agents and human sign-off.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 746 0 R
>>
endobj
